Hawkeye-data is the offline knowledge kit for Hawkeye (a doctor for
FreeBSD). It ships a compact knowledge.sqlite with FTS5 playbooks and
short recovery cheat sheets so Hawkeye still works with no network, a
read-only root, a missing /usr, or no LLM/GPU.

This is a sibling of sysutils/hawkeye (the binaries). The website is
a separate project (hawkeye-www). Embeddings are optional and are not
required for Tier 0 FTS.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/hawkeye-data
